            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se na nyina baramwishura, bati Mbega nta mwigeme n’umwe ari mu b’i wanyu canke mu b’iki gihugu, igitumye uja gusaba umugeni mu Bafilisitiya batākebge? Ariko Samusoni yishura se, ati Nsabira uyo, kukw ari we nagomwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
